      <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
        <details key="documentation" value="Specifies the maximum allowable size for events in MB.The maxEventSize attribute SHOULD only be set to allow single events larger than maxMemory; setting it to less than maxMemory will cause the value to be ignored.When maxEventSize is set, two buffers of size are created in addition to maxMemory.This means that the total memory used for event buffering is maxMemory plus double the maxEventSize."/>
