    <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
      <details key="documentation" value="A predefined XEvent action triggered after the event occurs - a call stack, say. Nothing but the package-qualified name of the action. MS-SSAS states this shape in section 2.2.4.2.2.4.3; xmla.xsd declares the element locally with no type at all, which shadows the global declaration that has one and makes the whole XEvent configuration opaque. The document is followed here, as it is for MdxScript's Command."/>
